   "text": "You are missing the point entirely, Skip; it is about accountability and the sheer absurdity of the situation you are describing. It is not a simple transaction; it is about power dynamics and how people evade responsibility when things go sideways. The whole thing reeks of something deeply wrong that needs to be exposed, which is why we need to keep these records."
